The '''[[2021–22 in Scottish football|2021–22 season]]''' was [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]'s 128th season of competitive football.

==Pre-season and friendlies==
Celtic held a pre-season training camp in Wales, with friendlies against [[Sheffield Wednesday F.C.|Sheffield Wednesday]], [[Charlton Athletic F.C.|Charlton Athletic]] and [[Bristol City F.C.|Bristol City]]. They also faced [[Preston North End F.C.|Preston North End]] and [[West Ham United F.C.|West Ham United]] at [[Celtic Park]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/may/Celtic-announce-pre-season-arrangements/ | title=Celtic announce pre-season arrangements | publisher=Celtic FC | date=25 May 2021 | access-date=25 May 2021}}</ref>

