==Scottish Cup==
{{Main|2021–22 Scottish Cup}}
On 29 November, Celtic were drawn to face [[Alloa Athletic F.C.|Alloa Athletic]] at [[Recreation Park, Alloa|Recreation Park]] in the fourth round of the [[2021–22 Scottish Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/november/30/celts-set-for-trip-to-play-alloa-on-scottish-cup-duty/ | title=Celts set for trip to play Alloa on Scottish Cup duty | publisher=Celtic FC | date=30 November 2021 | access-date=30 November 2021}}</ref> On 22 January 2022, Celtic were drawn to face [[Raith Rovers F.C.|Raith Rovers]] at Celtic Park in the fifth round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/january/22/celts-to-meet-raith-rovers-at-home-in-next-round-of-the-scottish-cup/ | title=Celts to meet Raith Rovers at home in next round of the Scottish Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=22 January 2022 | access-date=22 January 2022}}</ref> On 14 February, Celtic were drawn to face [[Dundee United F.C.|Dundee United]] at [[Tannadice Park]] in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/february/14/celtic-face-away-tie-against-dundee-united-in-scottish-cup/ | title=Celtic face away tie against Dundee United in Scottish Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=14 February 2022 | access-date=14 February 2022}}</ref> On 14 March, Celtic were drawn to face [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/march/14/celtic-face-glasgow-derby-semi-final-at-hampden/ | title=Celtic face Glasgow derby semi-final at Hampden | publisher=Celtic FC | date=14 March 2022 | access-date=14 March 2022}}</ref>

