==Scottish League Cup==
{{Main|2021–22 Scottish League Cup}}
On 25 July, Celtic were drawn to face [[Heart of Midlothian F.C.|Heart of Midlothian]] at [[Celtic Park]] in the second round of the [[2021–22 Scottish League Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/july/Celtic-face-Hearts-in-Premier-Sports-Cup-last-16/ | title=Celtic face Hearts in Premier Sports Cup last 16 | publisher=Celtic FC | date=25 July 2021 | access-date=25 July 2021}}</ref> On 15 August, Celtic were drawn to face [[Raith Rovers F.C.|Raith Rovers]] at Celtic Park in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/august/Hoops-to-face-Raith-Rovers-in-Premier-Sports-Cup-quarter-final/ | title=Hoops to face Raith Rovers in Premier Sports Cup quarter-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=15 August 2021 | access-date=15 August 2021}}</ref> On 23 September, Celtic were drawn to face [[St Johnstone F.C.|St Johnstone]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/september/Celtic-to-face-in-Premier-Sports-Cup-semi-final/ | title=Celtic to face St Johnstone in Premier Sports Cup semi-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=23 September 2021 | access-date=23 September 2021}}</ref> On 21 November, it was determined that Celtic would face [[Hibernian F.C.|Hibernian]] in the final.

