===Group stage===
{{main|2021–22 UEFA Europa League group stage#Group G}}
On 27 August, the draw for the [[2021–22 UEFA Europa League#Group stage|group stage]] was made. Celtic were drawn in Group G along with [[Bayer 04 Leverkusen|Bayer Leverkusen]], [[Real Betis]] and [[Ferencvárosi TC|Ferencváros]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/august/Celtic-face-Bayer-Leverkusen-Real-Betis-and-Ferencvaros/ | title=Celtic face Bayer Leverkusen, Real Betis and Ferencvaros | publisher=Celtic FC | date=27 August 2021 | access-date=27 August 2021}}</ref>
