*'''Home:''' The home kit features the club's traditional green and white hoops. White shorts and socks complete the look.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/july/adidas-X-Celtic-FC-Reveal-2021-22-Home-Kit-Pre-order-Now/ | title=adidas X Celtic FC Reveal 2021/22 Home Kit. Pre-order Now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=13 July 2021 | access-date=13 July 2021}}</ref>
*'''Away:''' The away kit features a dark green shirt, with a gold trim and an embroidered four-leaf clover. The shirt is accompanied by dark green shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/june/Adidas-X-Celtic-FC-Reveal-2021-22-Away-Kit-Pre-order-Now/ | title=Adidas X Celtic FC Reveal 2021/22 Away Kit. Pre-order Now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=3 June 2021 | access-date=3 June 2021}}</ref>
*'''Third:''' The third kit features a white shirt, with pink and green vertical pinstripes and a dark green collar. The shirt is accompanied by white shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/july/adidas-X-Celtic-FC-Reveal-2021-22-Third-Kit-Pre-order-Now/ | title=adidas X Celtic FC Reveal 2021/22 Third Kit. Pre-order Now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=5 July 2021 | access-date=5 July 2021}}</ref>
*'''Fourth''': The third black kit released for the 2020–21 season returned as a fourth kit in both away matches against [[Hibernian F.C.|Hibernian]].

